{"seq":2,"slug":"procedural-animation","title":"程序化动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/procedural-animation","wordCount":1380,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"程序化动画\">程序化动画</h1><p><a href=\"inverse-kinematics\">反向动力学 IK</a> 让末端精确对位，但它只是更大图景里的一块积木。程序化动画（procedural animation）指用规则、物理近似与算法实时生成或修正姿态，而非回放预录关键帧——披风随惯性甩动、头眼追随目标、脚步自动贴合地形、蜘蛛八条腿各自找落点。它让角色对环境的反应从&quot;末端约束&quot;扩展到&quot;整体行为&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>程序化动画的共同范式是：每帧读取角色与环境的当前状态（速度、地形、目标），通过一组确定性或半物理的规则算出对姿态的修正量，叠加到 <a href=\"../playback-blending/layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a> 产出的基础姿态之上。它处在&quot;录制动画&quot;与&quot;完整物理仿真&quot;之间——比前者更适应环境，比后者更可控更便宜。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[基础姿态&lt;br/&gt;来自混合/分层] --&gt; Z[逐帧程序化修正]&#10;  B[弹簧阻尼&lt;br/&gt;次级运动/惯性] --&gt; Z&#10;  C[注视系统&lt;br/&gt;头眼追目标] --&gt; Z&#10;  D[足部贴地&lt;br/&gt;射线检测 + foot IK] --&gt; Z&#10;  E[程序化步态&lt;br/&gt;动态规划落点] --&gt; Z&#10;  Z --&gt; O[修正后姿态 交给物理/上屏]\">flowchart TD\n  A[基础姿态&lt;br/&gt;来自混合/分层] --&gt; Z[逐帧程序化修正]\n  B[弹簧阻尼&lt;br/&gt;次级运动/惯性] --&gt; Z\n  C[注视系统&lt;br/&gt;头眼追目标] --&gt; Z\n  D[足部贴地&lt;br/&gt;射线检测 + foot IK] --&gt; Z\n  E[程序化步态&lt;br/&gt;动态规划落点] --&gt; Z\n  Z --&gt; O[修正后姿态 交给物理/上屏]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>典型对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>弹簧阻尼次级运动</td>\n<td>主体加速度</td>\n<td>临界阻尼弹簧</td>\n<td>披风、耳朵、胸甲、镜头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注视 (look-at)</td>\n<td>目标位置</td>\n<td>脊柱/头/眼链 IK</td>\n<td>头部、眼球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>足部贴地</td>\n<td>地形射线</td>\n<td>两骨 foot IK + 骨盆调整</td>\n<td>双足/四足的脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序化步态</td>\n<td>身体位移</td>\n<td>落点规划 + 摆动插值</td>\n<td>多足生物、机械腿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"弹簧阻尼与次级运动\">弹簧阻尼与次级运动</h2><p>迪士尼十二原则里的&quot;跟随与重叠&quot;在程序上由<strong>弹簧阻尼系统</strong>实现：一个附属物（披风、天线、尾巴）有目标位置（跟随主体）与当前位置，二者间用弹簧拉、用阻尼器减振。一维标量的临界阻尼弹簧更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{x} = -k\\,(x - x_{\\text{target}}) - c\\,\\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 决定跟随快慢，阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 决定回弹与振荡。取临界阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 2\\sqrt{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时既不过冲也最快稳定。这套规则同样用在<strong>程序化镜头</strong>（镜头弹簧式跟随角色）与 UI 弹性动画上——它是&quot;惯性感&quot;的通用配方，且极廉价，远处角色也能负担，不像 IK 那样需要按 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/performance-lod\">性能优化与动画 LOD</a> 裁剪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注视系统\">注视系统</h2><p>让角色&quot;看着&quot;玩家或目标，是 NPC 显得有生命的关键细节。注视把目标方向分配到一条骨链上：眼球转大头（占比最大但范围小）、头部跟上、脊柱微调，逐级按权重分担总偏转角，并钳制每段的最大角度避免&quot;猫头鹰式&quot;扭头。底层旋转计算就是单/多关节的 look-at IK（见上一篇），程序化的部分在于&quot;如何把一个总朝向合理地分配到多段骨骼、并随距离/视野平滑淡入淡出&quot;。注视常作为一个加法层叠加，因此与 <a href=\"../playback-blending/layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a> 的加法混合天然契合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"足部贴地与程序化步态\">足部贴地与程序化步态</h2><p>足部系统是 IK 与程序化规则配合的典范，分两个层次。<strong>足部贴地（被动）</strong>：角色仍由录制的走路动画驱动脚的大致位置，每帧向脚下投射线得到真实地面高度与法线，用两骨 foot IK 把脚拉到地面、旋转踝贴合坡面，并下调骨盆避免另一条腿被拉直劈叉。这能让一套平地走路动画自动适配任意起伏地形。</p>\n<p><strong>程序化步态（主动）</strong> 更进一步，连脚的落点都由算法决定，根本不依赖录制的腿部动画——多足机器人、蜘蛛、四足生物常用。基本逻辑：每只脚有一个&quot;理想站立点&quot;随身体移动，当脚离理想点超过阈值就触发一次摆动，沿一条抛物线插值到新落点，并保证不会所有脚同时离地（步态相位错开）。这类系统对地形的适应性极强，但落点规划与步态协调的规则相当精细。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>足部贴地（被动）</th>\n<th>程序化步态（主动）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>脚的位置来源</td>\n<td>录制动画 + IK 修正</td>\n<td>完全算法生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对动画资产依赖</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地形适应力</td>\n<td>中（坡/台阶）</td>\n<td>极强（任意崎岖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型对象</td>\n<td>人形主角</td>\n<td>多足/机械生物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与录制动画-物理的边界\">与录制动画、物理的边界</h2><p>程序化动画的甜区是&quot;规则清晰、需实时适应环境、但不需要完整刚体仿真&quot;的运动。一旦运动变得高度依赖碰撞与受力（角色被炸飞、绳索缠绕、布料褶皱），就该交给真正的物理仿真——那是 <a href=\"physics-ragdoll\">物理与布偶</a> 的领地。反过来，需要精确表演意图（一段过场里的特定手势）的运动，则该用录制动画。程序化动画恰好填补这两者之间那片&quot;既要自适应又要轻量&quot;的中间带，并常与二者混合：程序化次级运动叠在录制主体上、足部 IK 叠在物理布偶起身过程中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>程序化动画用规则/半物理实时生成或修正姿态，介于录制与完整仿真之间。</li>\n<li>弹簧阻尼造次级运动与惯性感，临界阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=2\\sqrt{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 既不过冲又快稳，极廉价。</li>\n<li>注视把总朝向按权重分配到眼/头/脊链，常作加法层叠加。</li>\n<li>足部贴地用射线 + foot IK 适配地形；程序化步态连落点都算法生成，适配崎岖地形。</li>\n<li>边界：高度依赖碰撞受力交物理布偶，需精确表演交录制动画，程序化填中间带。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"程序化动画","id":"程序化动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"弹簧阻尼与次级运动","id":"弹簧阻尼与次级运动"},{"level":2,"text":"注视系统","id":"注视系统"},{"level":2,"text":"足部贴地与程序化步态","id":"足部贴地与程序化步态"},{"level":2,"text":"与录制动画、物理的边界","id":"与录制动画-物理的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"反向动力学 IK","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/inverse-kinematics"},"next":{"title":"物理与布偶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/physics-ragdoll"}}